  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 703.01 Required Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 703.01 Required Information. Any local authority authorized to file information with the department pursuant to RSA 482-A:15, II, shall submit:\n\n(a) A map that meets the requirements of Env-Wt 703.02;\n\n(b) A written report that meets the requirements of Env-Wt 703.03; and\n\n(c) Documentation of the approval required by RSA 482-A:15, II.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 700) #12807, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt700.html"
